    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4999" root="جبن" body-key="j">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَبُنَ</span></b> , (S, Msb, K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَبُنَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُبْنٌ</span>
(Msb, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُبُنٌ</span> (K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَبَانَةٌ</span>; (Msb, K;)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَبَنَ</span>, (S, ISd, Msb,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَبُنَ</span></b> ; (Msb, TA;)
<i>He</i> (a man) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, such as is termed</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَبَان</span> (S, Msb, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَبِين</span>; (S, K;) i. e.
<i>cowardly,</i> (K,) or <i>weak hearted.</i> (Msb.) And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَبُنَ عَنْهُ</span> <i>He held back,</i> or <i>refrained, from him,</i>
or <i>it, through cowardice.</i> (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عرس</span>.)

